            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes. It is thicker and stickier, it clings to tools and gloves, and it cures slowly by drawing moisture from the air — a deep bead can take several days. Silicone skins in minutes and tools more cleanly, though it is unforgiving once it starts to set and needs solvent rather than water for cleanup.",
